<https://w3id.org/tesseract/construction-crosswalks/uniclass-ifc/mapping/018> a sssom:Mapping ;
    rdfs:comment "A space classification code names a kind of IfcSpace: the broader concept on the IFC side is the class, the Uniclass code is the discriminator. In a live model this row is realised as an IfcClassificationReference on the space, not as a class axiom - which is exactly why classification mappings survive every schema validator while carrying no checkable semantics." ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo orcid:0009-0001-7244-794X ;
    sssom:confidence 0.8 ;
    sssom:mapping_justification semapv:ManualMappingCuration ;
    sssom:mapping_set_id <https://w3id.org/tesseract/construction-crosswalks/uniclass-ifc> ;
    sssom:object_id ifc:IfcSpace ;
    sssom:object_label "IfcSpace" ;
    sssom:predicate_id skos:broadMatch ;
    sssom:subject_id uniclass:SL_20_15_27 ;
    sssom:subject_label "Enclosed offices" .

<https://w3id.org/tesseract/construction-crosswalks/uniclass-ifc/mapping/019> a sssom:Mapping ;
    rdfs:comment "An entity code names a kind of IfcBuilding. Same classification-not-axiom caveat as the SL row." ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo orcid:0009-0001-7244-794X ;
    sssom:confidence 0.75 ;
    sssom:mapping_justification semapv:ManualMappingCuration ;
    sssom:mapping_set_id <https://w3id.org/tesseract/construction-crosswalks/uniclass-ifc> ;
    sssom:object_id ifc:IfcBuilding ;
    sssom:object_label "IfcBuilding" ;
    sssom:predicate_id skos:broadMatch ;
    sssom:subject_id uniclass:En_20_15 ;
    sssom:subject_label "Administrative office entities" .

<https://w3id.org/tesseract/construction-crosswalks/uniclass-ifc/mapping/020> a sssom:Mapping ;
    rdfs:comment "IFC4 has no complex entity; a campus-scale complex is approximated by IfcSite with compositionType COMPLEX, or by site aggregation. The Uniclass Complexes table simply has no first-class IFC4 counterpart, and this row is the closest honest anchor." ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo orcid:0009-0001-7244-794X ;
    sssom:confidence 0.6 ;
    sssom:mapping_justification semapv:ManualMappingCuration ;
    sssom:mapping_set_id <https://w3id.org/tesseract/construction-crosswalks/uniclass-ifc> ;
    sssom:object_id ifc:IfcSite ;
    sssom:object_label "IfcSite" ;
    sssom:predicate_id skos:broadMatch ;
    sssom:subject_id uniclass:Co_25_10_32 ;
    sssom:subject_label "Further education colleges" .

<https://w3id.org/tesseract/construction-crosswalks/uniclass-ifc/mapping/021> a sssom:Mapping ;
    rdfs:comment "Table-level: Uniclass Ac classifies activities across the asset life cycle; IfcTask carries the scheduled-work case. Related, not close - Ac also classifies occupancy and operational activities that IFC represents nowhere." ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo orcid:0009-0001-7244-794X ;
    sssom:confidence 0.6 ;
    sssom:mapping_justification semapv:ManualMappingCuration ;
    sssom:mapping_set_id <https://w3id.org/tesseract/construction-crosswalks/uniclass-ifc> ;
    sssom:object_id ifc:IfcTask ;
    sssom:object_label "IfcTask" ;
    sssom:predicate_id skos:relatedMatch ;
    sssom:subject_id uniclass:Ac ;
    sssom:subject_label "Activities" .

<https://w3id.org/tesseract/construction-crosswalks/uniclass-ifc/mapping/022> a sssom:Mapping ;
    rdfs:comment "Asserted non-mapping, and the canonical part-whole error of construction alignment: a beam is a part of a framed structure, not a kind of one. Tools infer 'frame maps to beam/column' from lexical overlap constantly, and because Uniclass asserts no axioms whatsoever, no reasoner and no SHACL shape will ever reject it. The mereology/taxonomy confusion must be refused by a human, here, in the record." ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo orcid:0009-0001-7244-794X ;
    sssom:confidence 0.9 ;
    sssom:mapping_justification semapv:ManualMappingCuration ;
    sssom:mapping_set_id <https://w3id.org/tesseract/construction-crosswalks/uniclass-ifc> ;
    sssom:object_id ifc:IfcBeam ;
    sssom:object_label "IfcBeam" ;
    sssom:predicate_id skos:closeMatch ;
    sssom:predicate_modifier "Not" ;
    sssom:subject_id uniclass:EF_20_10_30 ;
    sssom:subject_label "Framed structures" .

<https://w3id.org/tesseract/construction-crosswalks/uniclass-ifc/mapping/023> a sssom:Mapping ;
    rdfs:comment "Asserted non-mapping at table level: Pr classifies products as supplied (the manufacturer's catalogue item); IfcElement is the installed occurrence in a building. The as-supplied/as-installed line is the construction twin of the as-designed/as-built line, and collapsing it makes every delivered pallet a wall. Products crosswalk to IfcElementType and material layers, each with loss, and that mapping is deliberately out of scope until it can be done per product group." ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo orcid:0009-0001-7244-794X ;
    sssom:confidence 0.85 ;
    sssom:mapping_justification semapv:ManualMappingCuration ;
    sssom:mapping_set_id <https://w3id.org/tesseract/construction-crosswalks/uniclass-ifc> ;
    sssom:object_id ifc:IfcElement ;
    sssom:object_label "IfcElement" ;
    sssom:predicate_id skos:closeMatch ;
    sssom:predicate_modifier "Not" ;
    sssom:subject_id uniclass:Pr ;
    sssom:subject_label "Products" .

uniclass:Ac skos:relatedMatch ifc:IfcTask .

