<https://w3id.org/tesseract/construction-crosswalks/uniclass-ifc> a sssom:MappingSet ;
    rdfs:label "Uniclass 2015 (verified codes) to ifcOWL IFC4 ADD2 crosswalk" ;
    rdfs:comment "Candidate-for-review crosswalk between Uniclass 2015 codes (verified against uniclass.thenbs.com, April 2026 table versions; see lift/uniclass_to_rdf.py) and ifcOWL IFC4 ADD2. Uniclass stratifies the built environment into tables (Complexes > Entities > Spaces > Elements > Systems > Products) while IFC types occurrences, so most correspondences here cross a strata boundary and say so. Rows with predicate_modifier=Not are asserted NON-mappings. SKOS direction per the SKOS Reference: A skos:broadMatch B asserts B is the broader concept; A skos:narrowMatch B asserts B is the narrower concept. Confidence is the curator's, not a computed score." ;
    sssom:license <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/> ;
    sssom:mapping_set_id <https://w3id.org/tesseract/construction-crosswalks/uniclass-ifc> ;
    sssom:mapping_set_version "0.1.0" .

